- [Consumer types](https://rocketmq.apache.org/docs/featureBehavior/06consumertype/)
- [Consumption retry policy](https://rocketmq.apache.org/docs/featureBehavior/10consumerretrypolicy/)
- [Message filtering](https://rocketmq.apache.org/docs/featureBehavior/07messagefilter/)
{% /section-card %}

